{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-422313-r4516864","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Banana and Pear Cake (Vegan)","sourcePageId":422313,"sourceRevision":"4516864","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-20T19:26:39Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Banana%20and%20Pear%20Cake%20(Vegan)&oldid=4516864","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:22:56.684Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cake","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using banana","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using coconut","Category:Recipes using dark chocolate","Category:Recipes using rice flour","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"a7bd59c56507d9b903ee1092b42f49bde026d8284d3550dd9ee8d48945e74b21","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Cake recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n== Ingredients ==\n\n=== Base ===\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Banana|bananas]], mashed until smooth\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] of [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n*½ cup [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n*1 cup of [[Cookbook:Rice Milk|rice milk]] or [[Cookbook:Coconut Milk|coconut milk]]\n* 2–2½ cups of [[Cookbook:Flour|white flour]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Rice Flour|rice flour]]\n* 10 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n\n=== Decoration ===\n\n* ~500 g of [[Cookbook:Coconut Cream|coconut cream]]\n* 250 g rose [[Cookbook:Jam|jam]]\n* 1 banana, peeled and [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]]\n\n* 1–2 [[Cookbook:Pear|pears]], peeled and sliced\n*100 g dark [[Cookbook:Chocolate|chocolate]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Coconut|coconut]] shavings\n==Procedure==\n=== Cake base ===\n# Preheat the [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 180°C.\n# Mix in the brown sugar, olive oil, and rice/coconut milk.\n# Combine both flours and the baking powder. Gradually mix the dry mixture into the batter.\n# Spread the batter in a non-stick cake pan.\n# Bake at 180°C until the cake is browned and tests clean when poked with a skewer. This should take about 40–45 minutes, depending on the oven.\n# When cooled, slice the cake horizontally into 2–3 layers.\n\n=== Decoration ===\n# [[Cookbook:Whipping|Whip]] the coconut cream until fluffy.\n# Spread the rose jam and cream between the cake layers, leaving some for the topping.\n# Decorate the cake with the remaining whipped coconut cream, the banana, and pear slices.\n# Grate dark chocolate on top if desired.\n# Stick the coconut shavings on the side.\n# Put the cake in the fridge for 15 minutes to cool and harden.\n#Cut and serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cake]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using banana]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark chocolate]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coconut]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]","isRecipe":false,"recipe":{"name":"Banana and Pear Cake (Vegan)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[],"steps":[],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review."